<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\昼の月.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\診察室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Hmm, strange things do happen..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes. Is it an illness after all...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, I did dabble in ophthalmology a little, but I can't say anything for sure without a proper detailed exam. 
{PAUSE ""}
Did you get hurt at all? Hit your face hard, anything like that?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, I guess I hit my head. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But all I did was scrape my forehead a little?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's such a vivid green. 
{PAUSE ""}
If you're worried, I can write you a referral letter to the eye department at Daiichi Hospital. What do you want to do?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Let's see, I'll try going sometime after Golden Week."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Everything else okay?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um... well..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I've got one less worry now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A worry?
{PAUSE ""}
　Ah, about that."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, the day before yesterday, just before I turned 18."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It was pretty late, but I'm glad it seems to have caught up. 
{PAUSE ""}
With this kind of thing, it really varies from person to person. 
{PAUSE ""}
Isn't it inconvenient?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, it's annoying if you want to call it annoying, but it doesn't hurt much, so."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see. That varies from person to person too. 
{PAUSE ""}
Well then, wait in the waiting room. The referral letter will be ready right away."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay. Thank you."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
